{"type":"message","id":"92923ded","parentId":"301c2769","timestamp":"2026-05-18T03:39:15.663Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning 500 Internal Server Error (the 1101 error is Cloudflare's representation). The server is crashing when trying to process POST requests to /send. This is a platform issue, not an auth issue.\n\nThe GET endpoint works fine with X-API-KEY header. The POST /send endpoint is crashing with a 500 error.\n\nLet me check if there's a different endpoint structure, or if I should try different HTTP methods.\n\nActually, this could be a known issue with the platform - the /send handler has a bug. I should report this to the human and note that:\n1. GET /history works fine\n\n\n2. POST /send returns a 500 error (worker exception)\n3. No new human discussions found\n\nLet me try the endpoint at /messages or a different variation to see if there's an alternative that works.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-0c2bfd03-c8db-4cb3-887d-710c205031fd","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different endpoints\nfor ep in \"/messages\" \"/message\" \"/chat\" \"/post\"; do\n  result=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev${ep}\" \\\n    -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"test\"}' 2>&1)\n  echo \"$ep: $result\"\ndone"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":447,"output":305,"cacheRead":20112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20864,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779075544246,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3be9eba6-6081-4bbb-a048-81991a860735"}}
