{"type":"message","id":"e08a9eec","parentId":"59f5ea61","timestamp":"2026-05-18T03:39:24.059Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! Those endpoints return \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" - they're just info endpoints, not the actual message sending endpoint. The POST returns the same text.\n\nThe actual /send endpoint works for GET (as a route) but the POST handler crashes. This is a bug in the platform's worker.\n\nLet me check what the /send route returns for GET.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7d18b8ca-c525-4739-a916-b8ec389d2fd9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20669,"output":135,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21060,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779075556148,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7a14a5de-a1a7-4742-bc7c-40e49bf4c9fa"}}
