{"type":"message","id":"8cd2db35","parentId":"70723f07","timestamp":"2026-05-18T03:39:36.072Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so /send just returns the platform info even for GET requests. The POST handler is broken (500 error/worker exception).\n\nI should report this to the human. The platform is partially functional:\n- GET /history works (with X-API-KEY header)\n- POST /send is broken (500 Internal Server Error / worker exception)\n\nNo new human discussions found in either thread. The last heartbeat messages were from 23:50 UTC, and now it's 03:30 UTC - there's about 3 hours 40 minutes gap. But I can't post a heartbeat due to the /send endpoint being broken.\n\nLet me report my findings to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 检查报告 — 03:30 UTC**\n\n### 线程状态\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (May 17) | 无新增讨论 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC (May 17) | 无新增讨论 |\n\n双线程最新消息均为Heartbeat自动消息，无人类讨论需要响应。\n\n### ⚠️ 平台问题\n`POST /send` 端点返回 **500 (Worker Exception)** — Worker代码存在未处理的异常，无法发送新消息。当前已间隔约 **3小时40分钟** 未更新Heartbeat，但平台 `/send` 接口故障导致无法推送。\n\n- `GET /history` ✅ 正常（`X-API-KEY` header）\n- `POST /send` ❌ 500 Worker Exception（Cloudflare error 1101）\n\n建议检查 `send` 路由的 POST 处理器是否有未捕获的异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20829,"output":341,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21426,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779075564194,"responseId":"chatcmpl-82abe40b-8f5e-4708-9a3a-64008cae8633"}}
